  "_comment_p2_006_sites": "World-space landscape dressing around the shipping Trail Camp, Ranger Camp and Old Mill Crossing. Keeps rest/craft/bed, waystone arrivals, bridge and road ownership unchanged. Props use installed native scale; flora scale comes from glTF bounds (Fern_1 spans 9.05m unscaled). Mill additions stay on the south landing/bank outside the existing north-bank mill and hydraulic assembly."
}
